<view class="page code-page"><view class="code-header"><text>出示给工作人员扫码</text><text>核销码仅限使用一次，请勿截图分享</text></view><view class="card code-card"><view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="state">正在生成安全核销码…</view><view wx:elif="{{error}}" class="state"><text class="error-text">{{error}}</text><button class="button-primary" bindtap="handleRefresh">重试</button></view><block wx:else><canvas class="qrcode" canvas-id="redemptionQrcode" style="width:240px;height:240px"></canvas><text wx:if="{{secondsLeft > 0}}" class="countdown">{{secondsLeft}} 秒后失效</text><text wx:else class="expired">核销码已过期</text><text class="expires-label">有效至 {{expiresLabel}}</text><button class="refresh-button" bindtap="handleRefresh">刷新核销码</button></block></view><view class="notice"><text>安全提示</text><text>同一张卡刷新后，之前的核销码会立即失效。实际扣减结果以工作人员确认核销为准。</text></view></view>
